{"id":"f3a4858795b9c601","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-definite-herbrand-operator.md","title":"确定Horn程序的Herbrand后果算子","display":"df-definite-herbrand-operator — 确定Horn程序的Herbrand后果算子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator","aliases":["72-df-definite-herbrand-operator"],"display":"df-definite-herbrand-operator — 确定Horn程序的Herbrand后果算子","depends_on":["[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §§2.1,2.6, print641–642,649–650/PDF653–654,661–662; local positive-program restriction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"明确Herbrand闭项集的语法来源签名","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"补入正 Horn 算子的完整类型及单调性"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-definite-herbrand-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-definite-herbrand-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-definite-herbrand-operator — 确定Horn程序的Herbrand后果算子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §§2.1,2.6, print641–642,649–650/PDF653–654,661–662; local positive-program restriction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"明确Herbrand闭项集的语法来源签名"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"补入正 Horn 算子的完整类型及单调性"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a> 的条件，至少有一个常元。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，每条子句的体仅含正关系原子；不含等式、负文字或内建谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，项集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarTerm}\">\\(\\operatorname{VarTerm}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:V\\to\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\sigma:V\\to\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为闭项替换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma\\)</span> 对项及正原子的扩张在下式递归定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>子句编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A,B\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A,B\\rangle\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为有限有序原子表；空表表示事实。下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HModel}_P\">\\(\\operatorname{HModel}_P\\)</span> 指原始Horn子句的模型条件。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\">\\(J\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为新增单调比较的第二输入；P 可等价声明为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{DefProgram}_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{DefProgram}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma):\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{R(\\vec t):R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma^{a_R(R)}\\},\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(x)&amp;:=\\sigma(x),\\quad\\widehat\\sigma(c):=c,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(f(\\vec t)):=f(\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=R(\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Gr}(P)&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(B_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|B|}\\rangle:\n\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in P,\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma^V\\},\\\\\nT_P(I)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma:\\exists B\\ (\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Gr}(P)\\land\\forall i&lt;|B|\\ (B_i\\in I))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\land T_P(I)\\subseteq I.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma):\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{R(\\vec t):R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma^{a_R(R)}\\},\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(x)&amp;:=\\sigma(x),\\quad\\widehat\\sigma(c):=c,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(f(\\vec t)):=f(\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=R(\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(t_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Gr}(P)&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(B_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;|B|}\\rangle:\n\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in P,\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma^V\\},\\\\\nT_P(I)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma:\\exists B\\ (\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Gr}(P)\\land\\forall i&lt;|B|\\ (B_i\\in I))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\land T_P(I)\\subseteq I.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_P:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_P:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq J\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T_P(I)\\subseteq T_P(J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\subseteq J\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T_P(I)\\subseteq T_P(J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>闭项集非空，因为签名有常元；有限项递归使替换唯一且所有输出闭。每个子句仅含有限多个变量，所以任意无关变量的替换值不影响该实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_P\">\\(T_P\\)</span> 读入的是二值真原子集合；模型条件就是全部闭实例“体真则头真”。这是正Horn子句的通常条件，区别于原书四值充分结构或双向completion，后两者还处理否证信息及支持条件。</p>\n<p>本轮扩充复核：给出 T_P(I) 成员资格的同一条 ground 子句，在 J 中仍有全部有限体原子，因此产生同一 head。类型由 Gr(P) 的闭原子构造保证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 满足 [[72-df-logic-program-syntax]] 的条件，至少有一个常元。$P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$，每条子句的体仅含正关系原子；不含等式、负文字或内建谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V=\\mathrm{Var}_S$，项集 $\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$ 与 $\\operatorname{VarTerm}$ 取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]]。$\\sigma:V\\to\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma$ 为闭项替换；$\\widehat\\sigma$ 对项及正原子的扩张在下式递归定义。$I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VarTerm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:V\\to\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A,B\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HModel}_P","display":false},{"tex":"J\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathsf{DefProgram}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma&:=\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma):\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma&:=\\{R(\\vec t):R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma^{a_R(R)}\\},\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(x)&:=\\sigma(x),\\quad\\widehat\\sigma(c):=c,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(f(\\vec t)):=f(\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(t_i)\\rangle_{i<|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(R(\\vec t))&:=R(\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(t_i)\\rangle_{i<|\\vec t|}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Gr}(P)&:=\\{\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\langle\\widehat\\sigma(B_i)\\rangle_{i<|B|}\\rangle:\n\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in P,\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{GT}_\\Sigma^V\\},\\\\\nT_P(I)&:=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma:\\exists B\\ (\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Gr}(P)\\land\\forall i<|B|\\ (B_i\\in I))\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{HModel}_P(I)&:\\Longleftrightarrow I\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\land T_P(I)\\subseteq I.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T_P:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"I\\subseteq J\\subseteq\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T_P(I)\\subseteq T_P(J).","display":true},{"tex":"T_P","display":false}],"bytes":3418,"backlinks":[{"id":"20ce4fc55dd53d44","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P,\\operatorname{Gr}(P),\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-definite-herbrand-operator]]；固定规则标签 $\\mathsf{horn}\\ne\\mathsf{ax}$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-418","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-definite-herbrand-operator|df-definite-herbrand-operator — 确定Horn程序的Herbrand后果算子]]"},{"id":"c3d353f164230c6a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma,P,T_P$ 取 [[72-df-definite-herbrand-operator]]；$\\mathcal D:=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma)$，$\\preceq:=\\{\\langle I,J\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D^2:I\\subseteq J\\}$，底为 $\\varnothing$。"},{"id":"f07e41c114d4b890","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P,\\mathsf{HB}_\\Sigma,T_P,\\operatorname{HModel}_P$ 取 [[72-df-definite-herbrand-